<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.sc_software_tools.sc_utility_suite_dist.UsbFlasher</id>
  <name>USB Flasher</name>
  <summary>Write ISO and raw IMG images to USB drives</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.sc_software_tools"><name>SC Software</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>Write Linux ISO and raw IMG images to USB drives to make bootable installers.</p>
    <p>Only removable USB drives are listed, never internal disks; the write can be verified afterwards. Drives are opened through UDisks, which asks for permission.</p>
    <p>Free to use; a one-time PRO licence (Gumroad) unlocks batch and advanced features. Files are processed locally.</p>
  </description>
